OL,3,GNEWSATwo killed in van crash on country
OL,4,Alane
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people were killed when a van
OL,7,Fcrashed off a country lane.
OL,9,FA 52-year-old man was pronounced dead
OL,10,Fat the scene on Station Road, Goostrey,
OL,11,FCheshire, at about 15:00 GMT, following
OL,12,Fan incident involving a Peugeot van.
OL,14,FA second man, aged 53, was taken to
OL,15,Fhospital but died from his injuries.
OL,17,FTwo other men, aged 48 and 49, were
OL,18,Falso taken to hospital but their
OL,19,Finjuries were not life-threatening,
OL,20,FCheshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
